removeBaseToken.t.sol
├── when caller is not the risk manager timelock
│  └── it should revert with UnauthorizedCaller
└── when caller is the risk manager timelock
   ├── given the base token is the accounting token of the Caliber
   │  └── it should revert with AccountingToken
   └── given the base token is not the accounting token of the Caliber
      ├── given the base token is not registered in the Caliber
      │  └── it should revert with NotBaseToken
      └── given the base token is registered in the Caliber
         ├── given the Caliber holds a non-zero balance of the base token
         │  └── it should revert with NonZeroBalance
         └── given the Caliber holds a zero balance of the base token
            ├── it should unregister the base token from the Caliber
            └── it should emit a BaseTokenRemoved event
